; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Punjabi / ਪੰਜਾਬੀ (pa)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ਭੇਜੋ counter 5

launch_loop:
ਸਿਸਟਮ_ਕਾਲ counter
ਘਟਾਓ counter 1
ਤੁਲਨਾ counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ਭੇਜੋ box 999
ਸਿਸਟਮ_ਕਾਲ box
